text+='| Pair | Order | Rust prefill (s) | Oracle prefill (s) | Rust steady tokens/s | Oracle steady tokens/s | Rust RSS (GiB) | Oracle RSS (GiB) |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n'
