text+=f"Passive timing attribution across the five native runs places a median {shares['prefill_transformer_wall_ms']:.2f}% of prefill wall time in the remaining transformer chain, {shares['prefill_tile_wall_ms']:.2f}% in bootstrap tile execution, and {shares['prefill_host_overhead_ms']:.2f}% in host overhead. These separately summarized shares need not add exactly to 100%; smaller output/handoff/residency intervals also remain. This identifies where to profile next but does not establish which 128K kernel dominates.\n\n"
